| Path | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| [`cv/guides/*.json`](./cv/guides/) | **Mandatory** official UEM guía scrapes (CD I · CD II) |
| [`oficial-guia-framework.mdc`](./oficial-guia-framework.mdc) | How hours, evaluation, competencies, CONTENIDOS bind all pedagogy |
| [`dc-cv-forge.mdc`](./dc-cv-forge.mdc) | Forge instructor CV / guía curricular from JSON |
| [`dc-unit-forge.mdc`](./dc-unit-forge.mdc) | One unit → lesson + studio + exercises (hours = guía, not FE) |
