## Re-sync

```bash
PROFIELD=~/src/profield/runs/digital-creativity
G=digital-creativity-pedagogy/grounding
cp "$PROFIELD/00-field-scope.md" "$G/"
cp "$PROFIELD/01/pass1.edited.md" "$G/profield-digital-creativity.md"
cp "$PROFIELD/01/pass1c.raw.authorities_directory.md" "$G/profield-authorities-directory.md"
# restore HTML provenance banners after copy
```

Upstream remains profield for pipeline artefacts; **this directory is the teaching-repo authority** once emancipated.

